    {
      "id": "fb08282f-3774-4524-a23c-c745e2d3e340",
      "content": "English: Abraham | French: Abraham | Latin: Abraham | Origin: &#1488;&#1463;&#1489;&#1456;&#1512;&#1464;&#1492;&#1464;&#1501; | Vietnamese: Áp-ra-ham -- St 17,5",
